rst kiss the scene goes into a  flashback when the two were still in  elementary school at an annual program  yuto got the role of the prince however  aoy was assigned a wildflower she wanted  to be the princess so badly that at the  climax of the drama she pulled yuto and  kissed him they still laugh about the  incident to this day in the following  scene aoi her parents and her uncle are  having a birthday dinner at her house  even aoe's parents are excited about the  notification which is scheduled in only  a few hours aoi's parents also met  through the government program but her  uncle is still unmarried it has always  been a topic that no one likes to talk  about so aoi doesn't dig into it later  she is given a dress that she wears to  bed as time passes she gets more nervous  but then yuto gives her a call they meet  outside and he hands her a gift for her  birthday it is a penguin showpiece that  goes well with her room yuto knows  everything there is to aio like how she  touches her hair when she lies he easily  finds out that she is nervous when she  touches her hair and claims that she  isn't to calm her down they decide to  reenact how she will introduce herself  to her chosen one aoi starts talking  about herself which makes yuto feel a  range of emotions especially because she  is looking at him like she would look at  her boyfriend he cuts her off and  confesses his love taking aoy by  surprise he also tries to kiss her but  she retreats in shock yuto is  dumbfounded and can do nothing but  apologize before they can talk further  they are interrupted by aoy's match  named sokuke he introduces himself and  gives her a bouquet of flowers the man  is better than what she had imagined and  is dashingly handsome mesmerized by his  presence aoi forgets about yuto he  congratulates them and leaves right  after giving the other two some alone  time to talk aoi turns towards her  prince charming in excitement but he  names a time and place before turning  around and leaving abruptly the poor  girl questions if she is dreaming before  returning home they meet at the said  place the next day which turns out to be  a fancy restaurant we find out that  sokukei's father is the chairman of a  big hospital and sokake is supposed to  inherit the wealth and position someday  he is also looking to go to med school  he is smart and ambitious but not so big  on conversation aoi continues talking to  cut the awkwardness but a while later  sokukei stops her he pulls her outside  making her blush because of their joined  hands sokuke then asks her who yuto is  but cuts her off before she even answers  he doesn't care what kind of girl aoe is  and thinks of their relationship as a  societal formality hence even if she has  more guys she is interested in it  doesn't bother sokoke aoi tries  explaining that she is nothing like that  but sokake cuts her off again the next  day at school her friends are jealous of  her for landing a rich and hot boyfriend  aoe agrees but deep down she doesn't  know how to feel about sokake in the  following week they go on several dates  all of which ahoy doesn't enjoy sokukei  walks too fast for her doesn't talk much  and never smiles at one point aoi feels  like someone is threatening him to date  her having had enough one day she  dresses up as a supposedly rich lady who  matches his status the dress-up is over  the top but sokake doesn't comment about  it aoy again tries making conversations  but he dismisses her with simple answers  she even inquires if he has told his  friends about her but sokake thinks the  question is outrageous because he would  never do something like that aoi leaves  the restaurant after another failed date  losing hope that she will ever get along  with him then she meets yuto who advises  her to meet his parents and find out  more about him so the conversations can  be more meaningful ayo agrees and goes  to his house the very next day sokukei's  mother is kind but his father 