 is quick to deny it  but then she touches her hair by now  sokake knows what that means he tells  aoi that her happiness is the only thing  that matters and if she feels like she  is about to be stuck in a loveless  marriage she should run away right now  he also promises to handle the guests  and the parents before encouraging her  to hurry up filled with tears aoi thanks  him and runs to the airport where yuto  is about to fly to tokyo for brain  surgery they meet at the terminal and  aoe expresses her love as yuto did on  the night of her 16th birthday initially  yuto freaks out asking her to return to  the church but in the end his dream  comes true and they share a kiss  leave a like if you're like me and  you're really glad this movie didn't end  with yuto's death  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

